# React + Vite

## Stack

- React 19 with the automatic JSX runtime.
- Vite 5 (`@vitejs/plugin-react`). Prefer `react-router-dom` v6 for broader Node compatibility.
- Motion: `import { motion, useReducedMotion } from "motion/react"`.
- Icons: `lucide-react` sparingly (nav menu, etc.).
- Styles: plain CSS + CSS variables. Colocate page CSS next to the page module.

## Structure

- Entry: `index.html` → `src/main.tsx` → `App` (router) → `SiteShell` → pages.
- Routes: `/`, `/product`, `/install`, `/plugins`, `/plugins/:pluginId`, `/gallery`.
- Plugin marketplace loads `registry.json` + manifests from raw GitHub (`replacearr-plugins`); do not copy that JSON into this repo.
- Static deploy assets live in `public/` (`CNAME`, favicons, `images/`).

## TypeScript & verify

- Strict mode. Run `npm run typecheck` after TS/TSX changes.
- `npm run build` must emit `dist/` and SPA `404.html` (`cp dist/index.html dist/404.html`).

## Dependencies

- Do not add Tailwind, CSS-in-JS, auth, or a docs/CMS stack unless explicitly requested.
- Do not reintroduce a hero background video.
